  "description": "The exact native adult fantasy ghoul: tall narrow lean humanoid with pale ivory-gray intact skin, angular gaunt face, pointed chin, wide pointed ears and small bright yellow-green eyes under a stern brow. Ash-blond coarse hair is swept upward at the front and hangs in a narrow long mane down the neck and upper back. Bare pale shoulders and upper arms. Dark mottled brown leather bib overalls with two narrow shoulder straps, silver eyelets and crisscross pale lacing over the chest and center back, close-fitting long leather trousers with a vertical row of round metal eyelets along the outside of each leg. Matching brown leather forearm bracers with eyelets and lacing. Bare pale elongated hands and feet, long thin curved black fingernails. Both hands are empty in every pose; preserve exact bent fingers, native foot shape, slender limbs and narrow body. Only ash-blond hair changes to native black or orange-brown variants; pale skin, yellow-green eyes, brown leather, metal eyelets and black nails remain unchanged. No weapons, armor, added accessories, new wounds, blood, particles or redesign. Preserve original dark shading, costume coverage and native action poses.",
